{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Live Translate offers real-time translation for games, videos, and chats. AN OPENAI OR GEMINI API KEY IS REQUIRED FOR IT TO WORK. The program captures system audio, translates it into over 50 languages, and displays it in a customizable overlay. It also provides accessible subtitles for hearing-impaired users. It is an ideal solution for gamers and multilingual content consumers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812790?t=1751067571","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3812790?t=1751067571","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812790/653d4de746c43299faa16ccbfe308231d737eda7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751067571","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812790/653d4de746c43299faa16ccbfe308231d737eda7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751067571","categories":[{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>New Feature: Explore the Visual World with In-Place Screen Translation</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812790/extras/1.gif?t=1751067571\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812790/extras/2.gif?t=1751067571\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812790/extras/3.gif?t=1751067571\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812790/extras/4.gif?t=1751067571\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet the groundbreaking In-Place Screen Translation feature added to our application! Now, you can translate not only audio but also the text on your screen in real-time. With a single press of a hotkey, you can have the text on your screen replaced with its translated versions while preserving their original positions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>How does this feature work?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you press the hotkey, our application takes a snapshot of the entire screen, intelligently detects all the text on it, translates it to the target language, and then erases the original text to place the translations in their spot. This way, you'll feel as if the content was in your language from the very beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlimited Use Cases:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In-Game Translation:</strong> Understand game menus, character dialogues, inventory descriptions, and more instantly in your language.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Film and Video Translation:</strong> Easily comprehend on-screen text in foreign films or documentaries without subtitles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Webtoons, Manga, and Comics:</strong> Follow your favorite visual stories without language barriers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Applications and Software:</strong> Use the interfaces of foreign programs effortlessly.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Press your hotkey and step into a new world where every text on your screen instantly makes sense!</p></p><br><h1>About the Software</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Live Translate offers real-time translation for games, videos, and chats. AN OPENAI OR GEMINI API KEY IS REQUIRED FOR IT TO WORK. The program captures system audio, translates it into over 50 languages, and displays it in a customizable overlay. It also provides accessible subtitles for hearing-impaired users. It is an ideal solution for gamers and multilingual content consumers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["DR Yaz\u0131l\u0131m","Sabri Yasin"],"ext_user_account_notice":"OpenAI ","genres":[{"description":"Audio Production","id":"52"},{"description":"Software Training","id":"56"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812790/987260dedcac05c0679d065bc06d0b78f00fbb62/header.jpg?t=1751067571","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257162520,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162520/movie480.mp4?t=1751067481","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162520/movie_max.mp4?t=1751067481"},"name":"Screen Translate","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257162520/fb442a77f5fe4c044f57c40f280a6c542b8a2cd1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751067481","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162520/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1751067481","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162520/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1751067481"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257162537,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162537/movie480.mp4?t=1751067478","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162537/movie_max.mp4?t=1751067478"},"name":"Live Subtitle","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257162537/e9ac1f741d6860dd6f3f5e5e875a2f42602bd8c5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1751067478","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2571625